Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: elizaos-app
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates, xdg-desktop-portal
Recommends: gnome-keyring, systemd, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk | xdg-desktop-portal-gnome
Description: Native elizaOS desktop shell and local Eliza agent
 This package installs the signed native GTK/WebKitGTK elizaOS shell, local
 Eliza agent, diagnostic and owner-controlled autostart commands, and hardened
 systemd user services. Autostart is disabled until the desktop owner opts in;
 package scripts never assume a live user D-Bus session. Package architecture
 is explicit because the authenticated upstream payload contains native ELF
 executables and may include architecture-specific libraries.
